# jvto-web — required environment (set the real values in each box's untracked .env.local)
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL — the canonical origin THIS deployment serves, no trailing slash.
# It is the single lever for SEO indexability + absolute URL host:
#   • live box  (javavolcano-touroperator.com)      → the value below → INDEXABLE + primary URLs
#   • help/preview box (help.javavolcano-touroperator.com)
#         → NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://help.javavolcano-touroperator.com
#         → automatically NOINDEX (X-Robots-Tag + meta robots), so the preview never
#           competes with live in search. When main is cut over to the primary domain,
#           the live box's value makes the SAME code indexable again — no code change.
#   • if unset → fail-safe NOINDEX (see src/lib/site.ts isIndexableDeployment()).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://javavolcano-touroperator.com

# NEXT_PUBLIC_ENV — set to "dev" ONLY for local/dev to disable next/image optimization
# (see next.config.ts images.unoptimized). Use "production" on real boxes.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENV=production
